			"notes": "# Changelog\n\n## Added\n**Molotov**\n- Non-ignited molotovs dropped by a player have a 50% chance to shatter on first surface contact (ground or wall): glass break sound, glass shattering particles, and one White Fabric dropped at the shatter location\n\n## Bug Fixes\n**Molotov**\n- Fire no longer spreads through solid walls, glass, or fences; each fire placement now requires an unobstructed line of sight from the impact point\n- Impact and spread flame particles no longer pass through walls; each particle direction is checked for line of sight before spawning\n- Dropped ignited molotov now correctly applies the 50/50 break roll on wall contact, not only when landing on the ground"
		},
