			"notes": "# Changelog\n\n## Bug Fixes\n- Dynamite and Molotov can no longer be ignited while the player's head is underwater\n- Ignited Dynamite and Molotov no longer emit dynamic light when the holder or entity is submerged\n- Going underwater while holding an ignited Dynamite or Molotov extinguishes it, reverting it to its unlit texture with a bubble effect\n- Thrown and dropped ignited Dynamite and Molotov that contact water have their fuse extinguished; they emit bubble particles and revert to their unlit item form"
